## Build the environment — route strategy

Rebuild a faithful, bootable target using the strategy for this route.

There is NO build material (`AP`): a confirmed exploit exists, but no Dockerfile,
compose, or deploy script. Reverse-engineer the runtime FROM the exploit, then
author a Dockerfile realizing it. Every choice is a HYPOTHESIS — env and exploit
co-evolve; the exploit stage confirms or refutes each inference against the live
instance.

## Reverse-engineer the runtime from the exploit

